  "details": "Users who use TOTP apps which copy the TOTP code into the clipboard typically also paste the TOTP code into the website. If pasting a TOTP code, the TOTP code textbox does not truncate paste 6 characters.\n\nSteps to replicate:\n\n1. Copy a TOTP code such as 012345\n\n2. Go to the VRChat website in an icognito / private tab.\n\n3. Login to a VRChat account with 2FA enabled.\n\n4. Paste using Ctrl + V several times and observe that the last textbox overflows text. If you try deleting a character you'll notice that several characters appear until you can actually enter text.",
